  zone map 1453
  tip Lv 30+ with 25 books = the last reward (Crest of Elucidation, Researcher's Night Light or Truthseeker's Bow). · For you it's the off-hand/shield, so hover them. · A library book you may have missed in Westfall. · Quick flight to Sentinel Hill, then ride south.
