step Mythology of the Titans
  zone map 1455
  tip The book is in the Scarlet Monastery Library wing. · It's a single book lying in the halls on the way to Arcanist Doan. · It's easy to run past, so watch the floor and side tables as you clear (it sparkles when you hover over it). · Loot it and hand it to Librarian Mae Paledust in the Hall of Explorers, Ironforge. · ~3,550 XP.
  complete 1050 "Mythology of the Titans"
  note Keep it: you hand this in later on the route.

step A Lack of Fear
  zone map 1455
  tip Dwarf priest quest from Lv 20 that teaches Fear Ward. · Check your spellbook: if Fear Ward is already there, skip it.
  turnin 5641 "A Lack of Fear" @24.7,8.2

