step Gnomeregan: grab in Ironforge + Dun Morogh, then run it (entrance 24, 39)
  zone map 1426
  tip Range 29-38. · Kill Mekgineer Thermaplugg.
  accept 2922 "Save Techbot's Brain!" map 1455 @69.6,50.3
  accept 2924 "Essential Artificials" map 1455 @67.9,46.1
  accept 2930 "Data Rescue" map 1455 @69.8,48.1
  accept 2929 "The Grand Betrayal" map 1455 @68.8,49.0
