  accept 2927 "The Day After" map 1455 @69.2,50.6
  task "Legacy: Gnomeregan" optional

step Save Techbot's Brain!
  zone map 1455
  tip Techbot is in the outer (non-instanced) part of Gnomeregan, so you don't need a group. · Go in from Dun Morogh. · At the junction before the instance portal, go right toward the Train Depot / punch-card area. · Go through the big room full of troggs; Techbot (a small robot) wanders in the room on the east side, by the Workshop door. · He nets you, so fight him away from other mobs. · Loot Techbot's Memory Core and take it to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge.
  complete 2922 "Save Techbot's Brain!" map 1426 @19.8,31.9
  turnin 2922 "Save Techbot's Brain!" @69.6,50.3

step Essential Artificials
  zone map 1455
  tip These don't drop from mobs. · In the deeper parts of Gnomeregan you'll see Artificial Extrapolators: tall steam-powered closets along the walls. · Click one for 1 Essential Artificial. · You need 12, and one full clear usually gives everyone enough. · Turn in to Klockmort in Ironforge. · ~3,050 XP.
  complete 2924 "Essential Artificials"
  turnin 2924 "Essential Artificials" @67.9,46.1

step Data Rescue
  zone map 1455
  tip A punch-card chain. · Outside the instance (in the outer tunnels and around the entrance), kill Caverndeep Looters, Caverndeep Invaders, Caverndeep Pillagers, Addled Lepers or Irradiated Invaders until a White Punch Card drops. · Use it at a Matrix Punchograph 3005-A in the Train Depot (on the raised platform in the middle, or by the Workshop door) to get a Yellow card. · Inside the instance: 3005-B in the Dormitory, just past the Clean Zone, gives Blue. · 3005-C is further in, on a raised platform, and gives Red. · 3005-D on the lower floor of the Engineering Labs (near the end) gives the Prismatic Punch Card.
  complete 2930 "Data Rescue"
  turnin 2930 "Data Rescue" @69.8,48.1

step The Grand Betrayal
  zone map 1455
  tip Just kill Mekgineer Thermaplugg, the last boss of Gnomeregan. · When he's low, bombs come out of the wall vents. · Someone has to click the buttons on the walls to shut the vents, and you keep healing. · ~2,750 XP. · Holy BiS: reward Civinad Robes (Lv 40 chest). · Gnomeregan quest.
  complete 2929 "The Grand Betrayal"
  turnin 2929 "The Grand Betrayal" @68.8,49.0

step Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators
  zone map 1453
  tip Bring twenty-four Robo-mechanical Guts to Shoni in Stormwind. · You already have this one in your log. ~2,450 XP.
  complete 2928 "Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators" map 1426 @18.1,39.3
  turnin 2928 "Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators" @62.6,34.1

