step Gnomeregan: grab in Ironforge + Dun Morogh, then run it (entrance 24, 39) · round 2
  zone map 1426
  accept 2926 "Gnogaine" @45.9,49.4

step Gnogaine
  zone map 1426
  tip Ozzie gives you an Empty Leaden Collection Phial. · Go to the Gnomeregan entrance area in west Dun Morogh (the airfield, ~24, 39) and use the phial on Irradiated Invaders or Irradiated Pillagers (troggs) while they're alive. · It fills up over a few uses. · Bring the Full Leaden Collection Phial back to Ozzie in Kharanos, and he hands you The Only Cure is More Green Glow. · ~2,200 XP.
  complete 2926 "Gnogaine"
  turnin 2926 "Gnogaine" @45.9,49.4

step Gnomeregan: grab in Ironforge + Dun Morogh, then run it (entrance 24, 39) · round 3
  zone map 1426
  accept 2962 "The Only Cure is More Green Glow" @45.9,49.4

step The Only Cure is More Green Glow
  zone map 1426
  tip Ozzie gives you a Heavy Leaden Collection Phial. · Inside the Gnomeregan instance, go to the bottom floor of the Hall of Gears (the first big round room; you get down through the Clean Zone). · Use the phial on a living Irradiated Slime, Lurker or Horror. · It can fail, so keep trying. · Keep a free bag slot: the High Potency Radioactive Fallout goes in your bags and only lasts 2 hours, so turn it in to Ozzie before it expires. · If it runs out, you still have the phial and can go get more.
  complete 2962 "The Only Cure is More Green Glow"
  turnin 2962 "The Only Cure is More Green Glow" @45.9,49.4

step Theramore (boat from Menethil)
  zone map 1445
  tip Missing Diplomat continues in Theramore right off the boat. · Mage hands in Journey to the Marsh and gets Hidden Secrets (go see Magus Tirth in the Shimmering Flats) and Items of Power (bring 1 Jade + a Bolt Charged Bramble). · Tabetha is also the Tiara of the Deep NPC later.
  task "Boat Menethil → Theramore" optional
  task "Mage: Hidden Secrets + Items of Power" optional

step Mage friend detour: Shimmering Flats (on the way west)
  zone map 1441
  accept 1950 "Get the Scoop" @78.3,75.7
