step Get the Scoop
  zone map 1441
  tip From Theramore, ride the Barrens south to the Great Lift, then east to the Raceway. · Mage hands in Hidden Secrets, then does Get the Scoop (find the phrase for Tirth's strongbox) and gets Rituals of Power.
  complete 1950 "Get the Scoop"
  turnin 1950 "Get the Scoop" @78.3,75.7

step Rituals of Power
  zone map 1441
  tip Hold it: the book Rituals of Power is in the Scarlet Monastery Library (your Lv 40 SM run). · Then back to Tabetha in Dustwallow.
  complete 1951 "Rituals of Power"
  note Keep it: you hand this in later on the route.

step Stonetalon on the way
  zone map 1442
  tip On the walk through Stonetalon. · The camp is in the hills near Sun Rock Retreat (Horde town), so don't go into the town itself. · Start Scramble, then click the Mound of Dirt on the hillside just east · That hands in Scramble and gives you Wet Job, which points you to the Loch Modan dam · Walk through Stonetalon to the Peak, then south into Desolace. · You pass it entering Stonetalon from the Barrens side. · Lv 16-18 mobs, so it's free.
  task "Cozy Sleeping Bag · step 3" optional
  task "Cozy Sleeping Bag · step 4 (Scramble → Wet Job)" optional
  task "Stonetalon Peak flight path" optional
  task "Fury of the Land" optional

